he 10th International Joint Conference on Natural Language Processing; 1st Conference of the Asia-Pacific Chapter of the Association for Computational Linguistics and the 10th International Joint Conference on Natural Language Processing; Dec 1, 2020; Suzhou, China. 2020. https://aclanthology.org/2020.aacl-main.46 . [ Google Scholar ] 137. Barredo Arrieta A, Díaz-Rodríguez N, Del Ser J, Bennetot A, Tabik S, Barbado A, Garcia S, Gil-Lopez S, Molina D, Benjamins R, Chatila R, Herrera F. Explainable Artificial Intelligence (XAI): concepts, taxonomies, opportunities and challenges toward responsible AI. Inform Fusion. 2020 Jun;58:82–115. doi: 10.1016/j.inffus.2019.12.012. [ DOI ] [ Google Scholar ] 138. Castelvecchi D. Can we open the black box of AI? Nature. 2016 Oct 06;538(7623):20–3. doi: 10.1038/538020a.538020a [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 139. Deering''s California codes annotated. San Francisco, Calif: Bancroft-Whitney; 1957. [ Google Scholar ] 140. Moore G, Matlock A, Kiley J, Percy K. Emergency physicians: beware of the consent standard of care. Clin Pract Cases Emerg Med. 2018 May 20;2(2):109–11. doi: 10.5811/cpcem.2018.1.37822. https://europepmc.org/abstract/MED/29849254 .cpcem-02-109 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 141. Proposal for a DIRECTIVE OF THE EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT AND OF THE COUNCIL on adapting non-contractual civil liability rules to artificial intelligence (AI Liability Directive) European Commission. 2022. Sep 28, [2023-04-08]. https://commission.europa.eu/system/files/2022-09/1_1_197605_prop_dir_ai_en.pdf . 142. New liability rules on products and AI to protect consumers and foster innovation. European Commission. 2022. Sep 28, [2022-10-01]. https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/ip_22_5807 . 143. Forcier M, Gallois H, Mullan S, Joly Y. Integrating artificial intelligence into health care through data access: can the GDPR act as a beacon for policymakers? J Law Biosci. 2019 Oct;6(1):317–35. doi: 10